sentences.text:
The Committal Court is directed to release the petitioner/accused No.1 on bail in Crime No.341/2023, subject to the following conditions:-
NC: 2023:KHC:25408 i) Petitioner shall execute personal bond in a sum of Rs.1,00,000/- (Rupees one Lakh only) with a surety for likesum to the satisfaction of the trial Court;
ii) Petitioner shall not tamper with the prosecution witnesses directly or indirectly;
iii) Petitioner shall not indulge in similar offences strictly;
iv) Petitioner shall appear before the Investigating Officer as and when called for the purpose of investigation.

